<section class="hpSec" id="hpAbout">
  <h2>About</h2>
  <p>coPaint is a free online paint tool and digital whiteboard built for young artists, students, and teachers. Enjoy big buttons, friendly tools, and classic MS Paint-style simplicity — everything needed to sketch, color, and draw together with zero clutter. Designed as a free online whiteboard for teaching and collaborative drawing, room creators can start a session, watch every canvas live, guide students in realtime, and export everyone's work into a single PDF.</p>
  <p>The app is 100% free with no login, no downloads, and no tracking. Perfect for kids, parents, and schools to create and share.</p>
</section>
